The Hyprland, Waybar and keybinding configuration in this directory is derived
from Omarchy's own Lua configuration, on its dev branch (4.0.0.alpha) — the same
branch the menu (bin/march-menu and the helpers around it) follows for its tree,
its routes and its bar layout. The look and feel is Omarchy v3.8.4's, which the
Lua branch carries over unchanged.

